<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well established - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well established - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Wednesday's close, USDA said. Carcass basis Steers and heifers not well established.</p>
<p>Steers - Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1200-1250 lbs few 103.50.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Thurs -  100  Week to Date - 11,100.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
